  "lead_time": 24.038,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 16,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "We believe in making the world a better place, and we're trying to do that",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8768D15AA6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 152,
        "text": "Keith Kirkland: We believe in making the world a better place, and we're trying to do that through design, but the world for us starts with our company.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EB6074FF83",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 8,
        "endOffset": 111,
        "text": "Our first product, Wayband, is a wearable haptic navigation device for the blind and visually impaired.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3078385DD7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "We had gotten an article published and it had made its way to this guy, Simon Wheatcroft.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3F132AAAF0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 39,
        "endOffset": 134,
        "text": "If you can have this technology ready by November, I'll run the New York City Marathon with it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5E12A35833",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 32,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "moonshot",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F0EEE24495",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 126,
        "text": "We saw it and was kind of like, moonshot, this is probably not going to work, but let's just do it and see how far we can get.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "319E9E7DC7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "(Music) [Dropbox is a collaborative platform whose mission is to design a more enlightened way of working.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E7BF8B3D3D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 135,
        "endOffset": 178,
        "text": "microcosm that reflects a greater macrocosm",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6816237184",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 93,
        "endOffset": 217,
        "text": "Jennifer Brook: In Keith's story, I see a microcosm that reflects a greater macrocosm in terms of an emerging set of values.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FF8D528A2D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 89,
        "endOffset": 122,
        "text": "making a living and making a life",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D55B061B84",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 127,
        "endOffset": 194,
        "text": "fulfilling the organization's needs and the needs of the individual",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4E6847FA6D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 195,
        "text": "What we found is that everyone has a set of tensions in their work and life, things like making a living and making a life, or fulfilling the organization's needs and the needs of the individual.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3D577F6BA5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 125,
        "text": "We navigate those tensions using our own unique strategies, for example, working remotely, learning new skills, or self care.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "83F178B79B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 106,
        "endOffset": 172,
        "text": "sense of purpose or our connection to our families and communities",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B878D822CC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 173,
        "text": "Navigating these tensions is critical, because a lot is at stake for us when we show up to work, like our sense of purpose or our connection to our families and communities.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E45F48CA2A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 111,
        "text": "And for me, in this organization, this is why we should care about designing a more enlightened way of working.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ED0FDB887D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 26,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "vehicle to design life",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "68F74FD4F2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "KK: We see a company as a vehicle to design life with as opposed to something to conform to.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F4BB0FB670",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "JB: WearWorks is really thinking holistically about navigating their tensions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "49CA2D9E12",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 45,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "making a living and making a life",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3023CA94B0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 197,
        "text": "For example, when it comes to a tension like making a living and making a life, what kinds of cultural practices and policies need to be in place to support a strategy like flexible or remote work?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8509E290C0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 155,
        "text": "KK: At WearWorks, we have this policy called WhereverWorks, and the basic idea is that we don't really care where people are as long as the work gets done.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AE895381FD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 39,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "ridiculously happy",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "073D6ECC8C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "And by doing so, we make our employees ridiculously happy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CC02A4409A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "And by doing that, we get the best work from people.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "77CB1B4F1F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 97,
        "text": "JB: We're seeing that people everywhere are challenging these inherited, default ways of working.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "67C67AFC51",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 20,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "more choices, more agency",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E7752A3DA8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "They want access to more choices, more agency, the freedom to decide how they want to work.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "26624A9161",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 126,
        "text": "This supports them to better navigate the tensions in their work and life for the sake of preserving what's at stake for them.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "46EFCC0863",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 144,
        "text": "KK: We did a six-month sprint, and on November 5, 2017, Simon ran the first 15 miles of the New York City Marathon without any sight assistance.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3ECCAF678B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "Working with the blind and visually impaired was a wonderful challenge.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A7B9D18692",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 90,
        "endOffset": 119,
        "text": "helped the needle of humanity",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DC6011B7D0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 147,
        "text": "It's a different feeling when you go to work every day and the thing that you do actually helped the needle of humanity, in some way, move forward.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6A018752CC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "JB: WearWorks embodies what an enlightened way of working means for people out in the world today.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BC427B78CF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 7,
        "text": "(Music)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E1F84F8F02",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
